  "comment": "Sound banks for `npm run assets` (docs/ASSETS.md §9). Each bank becomes one mono OGG Vorbis file with every sound's variants as [offset, duration] regions in the manifest. A sound takes `source` + `files` (a licensed pack in the raw library, D:\\dev\\raw or HK_RAW_DIR) or `synth` + `seeds` (tools/audio/synth.mjs). `gain` is dB after normalisation (one-shots peak -1 dBFS, loops RMS -20 dBFS); optional `lowpass`/`highpass` Hz and `maxLength` s.",
